      {
        "finding": "The authors report slight early-stage training-loss increases and nearly unchanged later-stage loss; Figure 2(a) reports VGG16 Hessian trace falling from 1809.27 to 1364.97.",
        "proposed_claim": "SOS can reduce unnormalized Hessian sharpness while approximately preserving training loss.",
        "row_ids": [
          "R29",
