        ]
      },
      {
        "finding": "Despite the prose claiming detection improvements, Table 5 reports lower mAP with SOS: 83.4 versus 83.7 for YOLOv5s and 87.1 versus 87.4 for YOLOv5x.",
        "proposed_claim": "SOS's reported classification gains do not extend consistently to object detection in the supplied tables.",
